type: software
title: "molecular-simulations"
abstract: >
  A Python toolkit for building, running, and analyzing molecular dynamics
  simulations using the AMBER force field ecosystem with OpenMM, scaling
  workflows on HPC via Parsl, and providing analysis utilities for clustering
  and protein interface scoring.
